SPECIFICATION.md-123-## Required engineering properties
SPECIFICATION.md-124-
SPECIFICATION.md-125-- Compile C with `-std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -pedantic -pthread`.
SPECIFICATION.md-126-- Keep implementation under `src/` and headers under `include/`.
